{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Stones of shoham.</b> For the needs of the ephod and the breastpiece — how so? Stones of shoham for the ephod, as it is written: ״ולקחת את שתי אבני שהם״, and it is written: ״ושמת את שתי האבנים על כתפות האפוד״. And stones of filling for the breastpiece, as it is written: ״ומלאת בו מלואת אבן״ etc. And in this manner we find many verses that are expounded: ״המגביהי לשבת״, ״המשפילי לראות בשמים ובארץ״. And furthermore you find stones of shoham for the need of the breastpiece, as it is written: ״והטור הרביעי תרשיש שהם״."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:04:02.068011770Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}